  "assertions": [
    "Real PostgreSQL and durable custody bind the manifest, accepted file, owner-only review, availability offer and newly owned copy. Exact-key capture, offer, copy and dispatch replays preserve the original receipts.",
    "Stock HTTPS retrieval yields the exact payload under the active receive view. Ordinary direct read, sender-only metadata and new offer authority remain out of reach for the receiving identity.",
    "The operator provisions a separate pinned SFTP route. Agent authority survives provision and revocation unchanged. The agent gets its own explicit delivery and workflow permissions and approves the onward work independently.",
    "Independent sshd stores the exact copied bytes and stock sftp reads them back. Revocation prevents queued work from contacting sshd. The availability trace retains unknown retrieval, receiver persistence and business processing."
  ],
